# The ending moonfall (data/endings/moonfall.json): the narration the ending screen plays before its slides. The Vagrant tells it
# afterwards: second person, present tense, one or two sentences a line, no game words. First draft by Claude; Gemini edits it.

~ start
Narrator: On the thirteenth night the moon stops falling slow and starts falling fast, and its grin fills the whole sky.
Narrator: The Hollow goes white, and then it goes quiet, and the Vagrant's song stops in the middle of a verse.
